// Package cref exposes the internals of pffft.c, including its static functions and
// SIMD macros, so that the Go port in package pffft can be tested against it.
//
// All slices are float32 views of v4sf arrays and must be 16-byte aligned.
//
// SLOP: Fully generated by Claude
package cref

